+
+### Schema Compliance ✅
+
+All values match the schema in `config.yaml`:
+
+- `gateway_port`: integer in range 1-65535
+- `gateway_bind_mode`: one of ["loopback", "lan"]
+- `allow_insecure_auth`: boolean
+- `enable_terminal`: boolean
+
+## Logs Analysis
+
+### Startup Sequence (16:56:33)
+
+```
+1. s6-rc init system starts
+2. [INFO] Bootstrapping OpenClaw config
+3. INFO: Updated gateway settings
+4. [INFO] Starting OpenClaw gateway...
+5. [INFO] Starting ttyd web terminal...
