+
+### Key Log Entries
+
+- ✅ Gateway listening on `ws://0.0.0.0:18789`
+- ✅ ttyd listening on `127.0.0.1:7681`
+- ✅ nginx worker started (PID 134)
+- ⚠️ Update available: v2026.2.1 (current v2026.1.30)
