+## Performance Metrics
+
+| Metric               | Value  |
+| -------------------- | ------ |
+| Container start time | ~1.5s  |
+| Gateway ready time   | ~1s    |
+| Memory usage (idle)  | ~250MB |
+| CPU usage (idle)     | <1%    |
