+## Security Observations
+
+### ✅ Good
+
+- ttyd bound to localhost only (not exposed directly)
+- Token-based gateway authentication
+- nginx proxy for terminal access (single entry point)
+- Secrets stored with proper permissions (umask 077)
+
+### ⚠️ Concerns
+
+- `allow_insecure_auth: true` allows HTTP gateway access (intended for LAN)
+- Gateway binds to `0.0.0.0` when in "lan" mode (expected)
+- No TLS/HTTPS support in nginx config (add-on assumption)
+
+## Conclusion
+
+**Overall Status**: ✅ **WORKING**
+
+All core functionality works as designed:
+
+- Container builds and starts successfully
+- All three services (gateway, ttyd, nginx) running
+- Port mappings correct (except 7681 intentionally localhost)
+- Configuration properly applied from options.json
+- Authentication working with token
